@tradition tap-night
// Tap night (0.60.7): the bartender's Friday: a drink of the week and a busy bar in the bow lounge. On at the same time
// as the music jam on Deck 4, so you pick one. The bartender is the sim engineer's bar rota (no host here).
k: 447
title: Tap night
when: weekly friday
at: 20:00-22:00
min: 25
jitter: 30
where: 3 room Bow lounge: lounge-seat
hold: 1
who: bar-regular 85%, lounge-regular 50%, night-owl 35%, everyone 18%
anim: drink
from: The bow lounge bar

== mail
- Tap night tomorrow from {time} at the bow lounge bar. A new drink of the week, and the good stools by the window.

== ask
- Tap night later. I hear the drink of the week is green.   #funny
- Bar or jam tonight? Can't do both.
- Tap night at eight. First round's on whoever's last in.   #funny

== here
- Try the drink of the week. Brave of you.   #funny
- Busy tonight. Good.
- Another round? Just a small one.

== thanks
- You find a stool at the busy bar for tap night. The drink of the week is better than it looks.   #funny

== chatter
- Tap night's drink of the week was a triumph. Or a warning. Hard to say.   #funny
- Friday at the bar is the loudest the Wren gets.
